{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Grow Wild",
    "steam_appid": 3230260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and nurture your own beautiful wildlife habitats in this cosy, wholesome nature game<br><br>Relax in a sandbox nature simulator with a fully simulated ecosystem \u2014 everything is interconnected and constantly evolving, even when you're not playing<br><br>Attract, observe, and identify over 300 real-world species \u2014 from flowers and fungi to birds, bees, and beetles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for bees buzzing in foxglove, crows nesting high in ash trees, moths flapping about in the dark, snakes hiding under rocks, or spiders making webs in tall grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/066763c51035d922c51eee85276aad37.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know every plant and creature in your nature book, understand what they need to thrive, and see how they fit into the wider ecosystem and food web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/c7c154287f55594fad405e83796cde87.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for seeds and start growing habitats \u2014 plant wildflowers, build log piles, and create the perfect conditions to welcome new wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/861da8425f0efceb81cfae556518c3b3.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and relax as your ecosystem comes to life - even when you\u2019re not playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/f53ea98be0d8c848eaeab868f56068e8.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Simulated Ecosystem</strong> - Everything in the game is simulated and interconnected, from thousands of sun rays changing tree growth, nectar levels in flowers, animal life cycles, seasons, weather systems, and day night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent World</strong> - Your habitats evolve and grow even when you\u2019re not playing. The game time is 100x faster than real-world time, so if you come back one day later 100 days will have passed in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Species</strong> - Discover and learn about over 300 European plants and animals \u2014 each with unique needs and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Real-Life Nature Conservation</strong> - This game is created by Philip Sinclair who has been growing and building real wildlife habitats for over 15 years in the UK countryside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sid</strong> -\u00a0Sid is a fellow nature fan who\u2019s always nearby to help \u2014 or accidentally scare off a butterfly you\u2019re about to identify!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/d4e46a3269fbd61b1246451b542f4def.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and nurture your own beautiful wildlife habitats in this cosy, wholesome nature game<br><br>Relax in a sandbox nature simulator with a fully simulated ecosystem \u2014 everything is interconnected and constantly evolving, even when you're not playing<br><br>Attract, observe, and identify over 300 real-world species \u2014 from flowers and fungi to birds, bees, and beetles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for bees buzzing in foxglove, crows nesting high in ash trees, moths flapping about in the dark, snakes hiding under rocks, or spiders making webs in tall grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/066763c51035d922c51eee85276aad37.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know every plant and creature in your nature book, understand what they need to thrive, and see how they fit into the wider ecosystem and food web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/c7c154287f55594fad405e83796cde87.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for seeds and start growing habitats \u2014 plant wildflowers, build log piles, and create the perfect conditions to welcome new wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/861da8425f0efceb81cfae556518c3b3.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and relax as your ecosystem comes to life - even when you\u2019re not playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/f53ea98be0d8c848eaeab868f56068e8.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Simulated Ecosystem</strong> - Everything in the game is simulated and interconnected, from thousands of sun rays changing tree growth, nectar levels in flowers, animal life cycles, seasons, weather systems, and day night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent World</strong> - Your habitats evolve and grow even when you\u2019re not playing. The game time is 100x faster than real-world time, so if you come back one day later 100 days will have passed in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Species</strong> - Discover and learn about over 300 European plants and animals \u2014 each with unique needs and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Real-Life Nature Conservation</strong> - This game is created by Philip Sinclair who has been growing and building real wildlife habitats for over 15 years in the UK countryside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sid</strong> -\u00a0Sid is a fellow nature fan who\u2019s always nearby to help \u2014 or accidentally scare off a butterfly you\u2019re about to identify!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/d4e46a3269fbd61b1246451b542f4def.avif?t=1753965024\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>",
